  "story": {
    "zh": "2035 年，Nova：Shadow Fault 制造了新的故障。任务：追踪越权操作。诊断资源并恢复云城。",
    "ja": "2035年、Nova：Shadow Fault が障害を発生。任務：権限侵害の追跡。リソースを調べ都市を復旧せよ。",
    "en": "2035. Nova: Shadow Fault has caused another incident. Mission: Trace the privilege change. Diagnose the resources and restore the city."
  },
  "lesson": {
    "zh": "CloudTrail 风格记录提供操作者与操作线索；修复权限后保留业务读取。",
    "ja": "監査記録から主体と操作を追跡。業務読取を維持し権限を修正。",
    "en": "Audit records identify actor and operation. Remove excessive rights while preserving required reads."
  },
